'''Demon's Park''' (デーモンパーク, ''Dēmonpāku'', '''Demon Park''') is one of the first three [[Empress' Research]] maps, alongside [[Arcane Confluence]] and [[Servant of Darkness]]. It has four stages, and disappears for the rest of the day after clearing one, so it will take at least 4 days to clear the whole map. Once completed, the [[Wicked Axe]] event will be unlocked. It was added in [[Version 10.9 Update|Version 10.9]].

